    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i've also heard people argue that gender is strictly based on biology and that explaining it the way you suggested might actually be confusing or even misleading for kids. if i'm trying to be a good parent, shouldn't i at least mention that viewpoint so they understand why people disagree? or is it better to just stick to the \"diversity\" explanation you mentioned?",
