      "content": "At this young age, introducing conflicting philosophical viewpoints on biology can likely be overly complex and potentially confusing. It is best to keep the conversation centered on acceptance and empathy right now. Focus on the idea that everyone is unique and deserving of respect for who they feel they are. You can address differing opinions as when you discuss disagreements among friends, rather than getting lost in scientific debate.",
